WEBVTT

00:11:57.521 --> 00:12:01.077
and they were stopped from going to the markets.

00:12:01.077 --> 00:12:03.661
Musicians were silenced,

00:12:03.661 --> 00:12:05.618
girls were flogged

00:12:05.618 --> 00:12:09.101
and singers were killed.

00:12:09.101 --> 00:12:10.975
Millions were suffering,

00:12:10.975 --> 00:12:14.220
but few spoke,

00:12:14.220 --> 00:12:16.444
and it was the most scary thing

00:12:16.444 --> 00:12:22.530
when you have all around such people

00:12:22.530 --> 00:12:24.556
who kill and who flog,

00:12:24.556 --> 00:12:25.852
and you speak for your rights.

00:12:25.852 --> 00:12:30.059
It's really the most scary thing.